  "reasoning": "The fact describes that the defendant used violence and threats to prevent traffic police officers from performing their duties. Under the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China, this conduct constitutes the crime of obstructing public officials in the performance of their duties, i.e., the crime of '阻碍执行公务'. No other criminal conduct is described, so only this crime applies.",
